`$redaction-batch-job-create` → `$redaction-batch-recognize-run` → `$redaction-batch-review-draft` → `$redaction-batch-export-package`

## 结构化

`$redaction-structured-dataset-load` → `$redaction-structured-profile-columns` → `$redaction-structured-policy-build` → `$redaction-structured-export-run`

